# The napi platform-package scratch dir.
npm/

# NOTE: index.js and index.d.ts (the NAPI loader + raw type declarations) are
# NOT ignored — they MUST be committed. The loader selects the correct platform
# binary at runtime and is required in the published package. Regenerate them
# with `npm run build:native`.
